From 0d6fefdc8cdaa4125f125b80180ad7f39b00d410 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Jerzy=20Ko=C5=82osowski?= <jerzy@kolosowscy.pl>
Date: Fri, 14 Nov 2025 21:55:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] plugins/screencastborder: Add visual feedback for active
 screencasts

Introduces a new effect plugin that provides visual indicators when
screen recording is active. Users can see what's being recorded and
stop recordings directly from the compositor.

Features:
- Colored borders around recorded windows/regions/outputs
- Interactive stop buttons with drag-to-reposition
- Auto-hide with pin option
- Scene graph integration for proper Z-ordering
- KCM configuration module

Consumes the screencast plugin's D-Bus API for stream monitoring.
